guide forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring
title Winterspring & Feralas
faction Horde
levels 54-56
zone Winterspring
next forever/horde/50-60/04-azshara
# Built from the playthrough simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits
# 74-79) and machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Everlook (Gregor, Felnok, Harlo, Umi, Meggi) -> Ice Thistle yetis ->
# Chillwind chimaeras -> Everlook -> ride west (Raging Owlbeasts) -> Donova
# Snowden -> Salfa -> Frostfire Winterfall camps -> Salfa -> Donova ->
# Darkwhisper Gorge -> Winterfall Village -> Donova -> Salfa (beads) ->
# hearth to Everlook -> grind to 55 -> Mau'ari -> fly to Camp Mojache
# (Videre Elixir, Talo) -> Thunder Bluff (Morrowgrain, Hamuul, Nara, cloth
# donations, Druid and Paladin training) -> Orgrimmar (bind, cloth
# donations), where the next guide
# starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Umi's and Meggi's quests (3783, 6603) are taken on arrival in Everlook
#   and the yetis done straight away, since their hills are next to town;
#   the export takes them after its first hearth. That first hearth (54.7)
#   becomes a ride: Darkwhisper Gorge and Winterfall Village lie east of
#   Donova anyway.
# - The Desolace stop (visit 77) is dropped: its only "objectives" are the
#   Thunder Bluff cloth donations (7820-7822), which are just cloth carried in
#   your bags. The same goes for the Mageweave donations the export
#   "completes" in Azshara (7831, 7835).
# - Binds immediately replaced are dropped (Camp Mojache, Thunder Bluff);
#   the Orgrimmar bind is kept for the hearth at the end.
# - Dropped: In Defense of Frostwolf (7241, a battleground quest); Return to
#   Tinkee (4810: Burning Steppes, never on the later route) and Duke
#   Hydraxis' Poisoned Water and Stormers and Rumblers (6804, 6805: the
#   later guides no longer hand them in, the Duke's chain runs on past 60).
#   A Crew Under Fire (3382): six naga waves at 57 on Azshara's Southridge
#   Beach, with elite giants close by, for 600 XP, and a flight, a long ride
#   and a hearth.
#   Winterfall Activity (6241): no longer in the game; 8464, which the
#   route takes, replaced it.
# - Optional: Winterfall Firewater (5083) and Falling to Corruption (5084):
#   the Empty Firewater Flask drops one kill in ten. Winterfall Ritual Totem
#   (8471): the totem drops at 2-4%, and Kernda in Timbermaw Hold speaks
#   only to characters at Neutral, which the route does not reach.
# - Not taken: Guarding Secrets (4882, 4883, to Nara Wildmane here). The
#   Blue-feathered Necklace that starts it drops from Winterspring's
#   Moontouched and Berserk Owlbeasts only after Wild Guardians (4741) is
#   done, and 4741 is not even accepted until 05-eastern-plaguelands.
#
# Left open for later guides: The Everlook Report (6029) and Duke Nicholas
# Zverenhoff (6030, Plaguelands), A Strange One (6605), Runecloth (6031: keep
# 30 Runecloth for Meilosh), Wild Guardians (4521, Trull in Felwood), Falling
# to Corruption (5084) and Winterfall Ritual Totem (8471, both in Felwood),
# The Videre Elixir (3909, back to Donova), Are We There, Yeti? (5163: the
# goblins in Tanaris and Un'Goro), Rabine Saturna (1123, Moonglade) and the
# cloth donations.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Everlook

step Everlook
  tip Everlook is the goblin town on the east side of the valley.
  sethome "Everlook" npc 11118        -- Innkeeper Vizzie: the last guide binds here, so this usually ticks at once
  accept 6029                         -- Gregor Greystone
  accept 6030
  turnin 4808                         -- Felnok Steelspring
  accept 4809
  accept 6605                         -- Harlo Wigglesworth
  accept 3783                         -- Umi Rumplesnicker
  accept 6603                         -- Meggi Peppinrocker
  note Gregor's and Harlo's quests lead to other zones: keep them.

step Ice Thistle yetis
  tip The yeti hills start just south-east of Everlook. Every yeti drops fur; only Matriarchs and Patriarchs drop horns, so keep those for after the turn-in.
  collect 12366 quest 3783

step Umi Rumplesnicker
  turnin 3783
  accept 977

step Pristine Yeti Horns
  tip Matriarchs and Patriarchs hit hard: pull them one at a time.
  collect 12367 quest 977

step Umi Rumplesnicker
  turnin 977
  accept 5163
  note Umi's third prank targets goblins in Gadgetzan and Un'Goro: keep it for later.

step Chillwind chimaeras
  tip The chimaeras roam the snowfields south and west of Everlook. Stay clear of Mazthoril's cave: its blue dragonkin are elite.
  collect 12444 quest 4809

step Felnok Steelspring
  turnin 4809

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Frostfire Hot Springs

step Raging Owlbeasts
  tip Ride west along the road past Lake Kel'Theril; Raging Owlbeasts roam the hills north of it.
  kill 7451 quest 4521.1

step Donova Snowden
  tip Donova camps among the steaming pools of Frostfire Hot Springs, in the west of the valley.
  turnin 980                          -- From Krakle in Un'Goro
  turnin 3908                         -- Linken's letter
  turnin 6603
  accept 3909
  accept 4842
  accept 5082
  note The Videre Elixir comes from Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas, later in this guide.

step Salfa
  tip Salfa stands by the Winterspring exit of Timbermaw Hold's tunnel, north of the hot springs.
  turnin 8465
  accept 8464

step Frostfire Winterfall camps
  tip Pathfinders, Den Watchers and Totemics share the furbolg camps around the hot springs; Ragged Owlbeasts roam the slopes between them. Kill Totemics first. Save every Runecloth you loot for Meilosh.
  kill 7442 quest 5082.1
  kill 7440 quest 5082.2
  kill 7441 quest 5082.3
  kill 7450 quest 4521.2
  collect 12771 optional              -- Empty Firewater Flask, a rare drop from the Winterfall furbolgs
  accept 5083 optional
  collect 20742 optional              -- Winterfall Ritual Totem, a rare drop from the Winterfall furbolgs
  accept 8471 optional

step Donova Snowden
  turnin 5082
  turnin 5083 optional
  accept 5084 optional
  note Falling to Corruption is turned in at the Deadwood Cauldron in Felwood, on a later trip.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkwhisper Gorge and Winterfall Village

step Darkwhisper Gorge
  tip Ride east, then south down Frostwhisper Gorge. The Frostmaul giants there are elite level 59: keep to the middle and keep moving. The strange source is at the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge, at the south end.
  goto 59.8,74.2 "Darkwhisper Gorge"
  complete 4842

step Winterfall Village
  tip The furbolg village fills the valley north-east of Everlook. Kill Shamans first; they heal. High Chief Winterfall in the cave at the back is elite: stay out.
  kill 7439 quest 8464.1
  kill 7440 quest 8464.2
  kill 7438 quest 8464.3

step Donova Snowden
  tip Ride back west to Frostfire Hot Springs.
  turnin 4842

step Salfa
  turnin 8464
  accept 8469

step Beads for Salfa
  tip Any Winterfall furbolg can carry the beads; the camps just south of Salfa are the closest.
  goto 31.6,36.6 "Frostfire Winterfall camp"
  complete 8469

step Salfa
  turnin 8469

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back to Everlook

step Back to Everlook
  hearth "Everlook"

step Grind to 55
  level 55 -- grind on Winterfall Den Watcher at Winterfall Village, Winterspring

step A Little Luck
  accept 6606                         -- Harlo Wigglesworth
  turnin 6606                         -- Witch Doctor Mau'ari, beside him

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Feralas

step Fly to Camp Mojache
  zone Feralas
  fly "Camp Mojache"

step The Videre Elixir
  tip Gregan Brewspewer, a dwarf, camps in the Lower Wilds north-west of Camp Mojache; he has the elixir.
  goto 45.1,25.6 "Gregan Brewspewer"
  complete 3909

step Talo Thornhoof
  tip Back at Camp Mojache.
  turnin 4120

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thunder Bluff

step Fly to Thunder Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  fly "Thunder Bluff"

step Rumstag Proudstrider
  tip He stands on Hunter Rise. Each donation wants cloth from your bags; hand them in when you have it, later in the route.
  accept 7820
  accept 7821
  accept 7822

step Bluff Runner Windstrider
  accept 1000

step Elder Rise
  turnin 3761                         -- Ghede
  accept 3782                         -- Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem
  turnin 1000
  accept 1123
  turnin 4987                         -- Nara Wildmane
  train class only Druid,Paladin      -- Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; Alodan the Hopeful
  note Rabine Saturna waits in Moonglade: keep it for later.

step Bashana Runetotem
  tip Bashana buys Morrowgrain grown from your Un'Goro Soil.
  turnin 3782
  accept 3786
  complete 3786
  turnin 3786
  accept 3804
  complete 3804
  turnin 3804

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  sethome "Orgrimmar"

step Vehena
  tip In the Valley of Spirits.
  accept 7833
  accept 7834
  accept 7835

step Rashona Straglash
  tip In the Valley of Honor.
  accept 7826
  accept 7827
  accept 7831

